# The workspace editor layer (images/workspace/Dockerfile) uses the repo root
# as build context, so this file decides what gets uploaded to BuildKit.
# (Go services are built with ko; the base image uses its own directory.)
#
# Do NOT exclude anything a Dockerfile COPY needs: services/shell (agent),
# services/pi, images/workspace/**, and ui/theia/dist-image/theia.tar.gz
# (from images/workspace/build-theia.sh). Re-check the COPY lines first.

.git/
.github/
.DS_Store
*.env
*.local

# Docs and manifests no image copies (dotfiles/*.md ARE copied; do not use
# **/*.md).
README.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
CLAUDE.md
docs/
charts/
services/shell/*.md
services/pi/*.md
services/pi/test/
services/shell/test/

# Go: local binaries and tests.
services/manager/manager
services/authproxy/authproxy
services/port-router/port-router
**/*_test.go

# Node: dependencies are installed inside the build stages from lockfiles.
**/node_modules/
ui/portal/dist/
ui/portal/*.tsbuildinfo

# Theia is built outside BuildKit; only the resulting tarball enters.
ui/theia/**
!ui/theia/dist-image/
